{
  "date": "2026-11-22",
  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "金价一周大跌，几家大银行提醒客户注意风险",
  "title_en": "Gold prices plunge in one week; several big banks remind customers to watch the risks",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "这个星期，国际金价下跌得很快。11月21日，现货黄金的价格降到了每盎司3500美元左右，是大约14个月以来最低的价格。盎司是一种重量单位，人们常用它来计算黄金的价格。",
      "en": "This week, international gold prices fell fast. On November 21, the spot gold price dropped to about 3,500 US dollars per ounce, the lowest price in about 14 months. The ounce is a unit of weight that people often use to calculate the price of gold."
    },
    {
      "zh": "因为金价变化很大，建设银行、工商银行和招商银行都向客户发出了提醒。这几家银行表示，最近贵金属价格的波动越来越厉害。它们建议投资者合理安排，不要拿太多钱买贵金属，也不要跟着别人一起买卖。",
      "en": "Because gold prices have changed so much, China Construction Bank, ICBC and China Merchants Bank all sent reminders to their customers. These banks said that the fluctuations in precious metal prices have recently become more and more severe. They advised investors to plan sensibly, not to spend too much money on precious metals, and not to buy and sell just because others are doing so."
    },
    {
      "zh": "国内的金首饰也跟着便宜了。11月21日，一些品牌把足金首饰的价格降到每克1056元到1068元，比前一天低了20元到34元。和今年的最高价比，品牌金首饰每克已经便宜了600多元。",
      "en": "Gold jewellery in China has also become cheaper. On November 21, some brands lowered the price of pure gold jewellery to 1,056–1,068 yuan per gram, 20 to 34 yuan lower than the day before. Compared with this year's highest price, brand-name gold jewellery is now more than 600 yuan per gram cheaper."
    },
    {
      "zh": "世界黄金协会的数据显示，今年第三季度，全球金首饰的需求比去年同一时间下降了17%。",
      "en": "Data from the World Gold Council show that in the third quarter of this year, global demand for gold jewellery fell by 17% compared with the same period last year."
    }
  ],
